 [x] |","+| G7 | extreme scalars `INT_MIN` / `INT_MAX` / `0` / `-1` into every arithmetic entry point and into `checkshift` (wrap-around on `*`, `+`, `<<`) | `g_extreme_scalars_every_entry_point` | C2, C4, C6, C10, C24 | [x] |","+| G8 | `ComputeState` object representation (size 12, align 4) written/read across the FFI boundary by each `.so` | `c25b_compute_state_layout_agrees` | C19, C20, C25 | [x] |"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
